evidence = "Commit 8dc0d37ce04f002d216ab533a297389e013f15d5 deleted the still-absent services/wallet/ceremony/legacy-import/pnpm-lock.yaml, but tools/deps/floors/wallet-services.json:30 still requires it, tools/deps/lockfloor.py:240 rejects its absence, services/wallet/ceremony/legacy-import/package.json:25 pins vitest 4.1.12 in the separate workspace at services/wallet/ceremony/legacy-import/pnpm-workspace.yaml:1, services/wallet/pnpm-lock.yaml:7 has no importer for that workspace, and spec/layerx-merge/spec.kvx:119212 still requires its frozen install."
close_comment = "The legacy importer still lacks its own lockfile, so its dependency-floor check and frozen install cannot succeed. A follow-up task will regenerate the lockfile for Vitest 4.1.12 and add a focused check for patched resolved dependencies and a frozen install."

